-- Imported by deadlines.l4 and kept.l4: rules that read what a run
-- supplies, a ledger, the clock, the world outside the file and a section
-- GIVEN, so that a file importing them is held to what they read.

IMPORT prelude

`recorded period` MEANS fromMaybe 10 (RECALL `period`)

`clocky` MEANS ((DATE_SERIAL TODAY) MODULO 7) PLUS 3

`env period` MEANS fromMaybe 10 (TONUMBER (fromMaybe "3" (ENV "PERIOD_DAYS")))

GIVEN dflt IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`is taken` dflt MEANS fromMaybe dflt (RECALL OFFICIAL's `taken`)

§ `Terms`
    GIVEN rate IS A NUMBER TYPICALLY 3

GIVETH A NUMBER
`the window` MEANS rate TIMES 10
